# Local development overrides — committed to repo, safe to share (no secrets)
# These are defaults for running the frontend against the local native dev stack.
#
# Next.js loads this file into the dev server's process.env; next-runtime-env
# then serves these values to the browser at request time. Nothing here is baked
# into the bundle. See docs/adr/0001-runtime-env-configuration.md

